@startuml
[*] --> Task Assignment System Idle

Task Assignment System Idle : Waiting for task assignment request

Task Assignment System Idle --> Task Selection : on user initiating task assignment

Task Selection : Selecting a task to assign

Task Selection --> Self Assignment : on user choosing to assign to self
Task Selection --> Other Assignment : on user choosing to assign to others

Self Assignment : Assigning task to self

Self Assignment --> Check Availability (Self) : Checking availability

Other Assignment : Assigning task to others

Other Assignment --> Check Availability (Others) : Checking availability

Check Availability (Self) : Checking self availability

Check Availability (Self) --> Task Assigned : if available
Check Availability (Self) --> Conflict Resolution : if not available

Check Availability (Others) : Checking others' availability

Check Availability (Others) --> Task Assigned : if available
Check Availability (Others) --> Conflict Resolution : if not available

Task Assigned : Task has been assigned successfully

Task Assigned --> Task Monitoring : Monitoring task progress

Task Monitoring : Monitoring task progress and status

Task Monitoring --> Reminder Sent : if task is overdue or reminder needed
Task Monitoring --> Task Completion : if task is completed

Reminder Sent : Sending reminder/notification

Reminder Sent --> Task Monitoring : Continue monitoring

Task Completion : Task has been completed

Task Completion --> [*] : System returns to idle state

Conflict Resolution : Resolving conflicts or adjusting assignments

Conflict Resolution --> Task Selection : if reassignment needed
Conflict Resolution --> [*] : if no further action needed

Task Assignment System Idle <--> [*] : System is idle

@enduml
